OL,3,GNEWSAYour pictures as the season
OL,4,Achanges
OL,5,
OL,6,FDepending on which calendar you are
OL,7,Flooking at we are either almost two
OL,8,Fweeks into autumn (meteorological) or
OL,9,Falmost two weeks away (astronomical).
OL,11,FBut whilst we might be confused, nature
OL,12,Fcontinues at its own pace with the
OL,13,Fweather also setting some lovely
OL,14,Fscenes.
OL,16,FAs always, our BBC weather watchers
OL,17,Facross north-east England and Cumbria
OL,18,Fhave been out and about capturing them.
OL,20,FHere are some of our favourite snaps.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
